WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.541 --> 00:00:09.041
I see a fifth- or sixth-seed team

00:00:09.041 --> 00:00:10.041
[cheers]

00:00:10.041 --> 00:00:13.666
Who will, at best, make it to the second round

00:00:13.791 --> 00:00:16.708
We are the new Kings of the East!

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:18.416
Ugh, this again?

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.166
Didn't we do this last year?

00:00:20.166 --> 00:00:21.583
I defend anyone

00:00:22.583 --> 00:00:23.625
Except LeBron

00:00:24.208 --> 00:00:25.500
We'll take the horse

00:00:25.875 --> 00:00:27.333
Wait, I'm not a bust

00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:28.541
He says he's not a bust

00:00:28.666 --> 00:00:29.666
Oh, he's a bust all right

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:35.166
There will be a new King in the East

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:43.916
[terrible scream]

00:00:55.208 --> 00:00:57.833
But, why must you leave?

00:00:57.833 --> 00:00:59.833
I’m a free agent now

00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:01.291
Will you be back?

00:01:01.416 --> 00:01:03.625
Aye. One way or another

00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:05.875
But...but, where will you go?

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:08.333
I will raise the sails of me heart

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:10.125
and let the winds of destiny blow where they–

00:01:10.125 --> 00:01:10.916
and let the winds of destiny blow where they–
-C'mon mate

00:01:10.916 --> 00:01:12.416
You’re wearing a Lakers tunic

00:01:12.416 --> 00:01:13.708
Well...yeah

00:01:13.875 --> 00:01:17.166
Paul, you realize House Lakers are bad, right?

00:01:17.166 --> 00:01:19.750
Russ, in my years, I’ve come to accept 

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:23.041
that I will lose in the playoffs no matter where I go

00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:25.208
But Los Angeles has a beach

00:01:25.208 --> 00:01:26.208
[sniffles]

00:01:26.208 --> 00:01:27.208
[sniffles]
Alright, well

00:01:27.625 --> 00:01:30.958
I must be going. Grunion season is upon us

00:01:31.666 --> 00:01:32.500
Yah yah!

00:01:34.291 --> 00:01:35.625
Surf's up, mate

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:43.458
Aw, c’mon now, Russ. Don’t worry. I’m not gonna go anywhere.

00:01:43.458 --> 00:01:44.458
[sob]

00:01:50.125 --> 00:01:52.583
[murmur]
I actually kind of liked Pusha T’s diss track

00:01:52.583 --> 00:01:54.000
[murmur]
I don’t wanna tell Drake, though

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.791
[murmur]
I thought he went too far talking about Drake’s parents and all

00:01:56.833 --> 00:01:57.625
[bang]

00:01:57.625 --> 00:01:58.750
Shh, shh, Drake wants to say something

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:01.083
Shh, shh, Drake wants to say something
[bang]

00:02:02.541 --> 00:02:05.333
You’re wondering why I brought you all here

00:02:06.041 --> 00:02:09.958
After all, we just had a feast to celebrate our No. 1 seed

00:02:09.958 --> 00:02:14.583
And since when does Old Drake give two feasts in a single fortnight?

00:02:14.833 --> 00:02:16.416
[murmur]
Yeah, we love you Drake!

00:02:17.208 --> 00:02:19.625
Well it’s no good being Lord of the Six

00:02:19.625 --> 00:02:23.500
if you can’t celebrate a 
first-round victory with your woes

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:26.083
The great knights of House Raptors!

00:02:26.083 --> 00:02:27.541
Yeah!

00:02:27.541 --> 00:02:28.583
Yeah!
Yeah, we're the North!

00:02:28.583 --> 00:02:32.458
Sure, the scribes, they don’t want to talk about us

00:02:32.541 --> 00:02:34.416
[grunts]

00:02:34.458 --> 00:02:36.583
Some dingy house in the North

00:02:36.583 --> 00:02:37.833
[laughs]

00:02:37.833 --> 00:02:43.041
They all just want to talk about The Process

00:02:43.041 --> 00:02:43.583
Boo!

00:02:43.583 --> 00:02:44.541
Boo!
Ben Simmons can suck my–

00:02:44.541 --> 00:02:47.625
And the washed up King LeBron

00:02:47.625 --> 00:02:49.291
Boo!
I hate LeBron!

00:02:49.291 --> 00:02:56.791
Well I say, LeBron can have his stupid Feast of the East

00:02:56.791 --> 00:02:58.208
Yeah!

00:02:58.208 --> 00:03:02.500
This year, the North will feast

00:03:02.541 --> 00:03:04.166
on the East!

00:03:04.166 --> 00:03:07.208
[cheer]

00:03:07.208 --> 00:03:10.041
But first, a toast!

00:03:11.166 --> 00:03:13.583
No more of that southern horse piss

00:03:13.583 --> 00:03:14.250
No more of that southern horse piss

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:17.208
Proper wine for proper knights

00:03:17.666 --> 00:03:21.000
Courtesy of your Champagne Papi

00:03:21.958 --> 00:03:23.208
Stand together!

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:27.041
North...over everything!

00:03:27.416 --> 00:03:29.500
North over everything!

00:03:35.791 --> 00:03:36.916
Not you

00:03:37.291 --> 00:03:40.041
I’m not wasting good wine on a damn horse

00:03:41.458 --> 00:03:47.875
Here, to the men who slaughtered
the Wizards in only six games

00:03:47.875 --> 00:03:49.208
That's right, we did!
Yeah, they suck!

00:03:50.666 --> 00:03:53.666
Yes, yes. Cheer.

00:03:53.666 --> 00:03:55.958
Brave men. All of you

00:03:56.208 --> 00:03:58.958
Took six games to beat a house

00:03:58.958 --> 00:04:03.208
that had three less wins this year than the Nuggets

00:04:03.541 --> 00:04:05.250
That's right! Oh...

00:04:06.708 --> 00:04:10.583
Haven’t you little northern knights learned?

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:14.041
After all these years, 

00:04:14.041 --> 00:04:16.875
killing pawns means nothing

00:04:16.916 --> 00:04:20.750
if you can’t fell the King

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:23.291
[choking]

00:04:23.291 --> 00:04:24.833
Am I dying?

00:04:24.833 --> 00:04:28.291
No, we're just choking. You'll get used to it.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:39.750
When people ask you what happened here, tell them King James still rules the East

00:04:41.166 --> 00:04:44.458
Also, tell them I’m better than Michael Jordan

00:05:04.666 --> 00:05:07.583
King James has slaughtered the Raptors in four battles

00:05:08.458 --> 00:05:11.666
But I thought The Messiah Ujiri could walk on water

00:05:11.666 --> 00:05:14.250
Wah! Any other Master of Trades would be torched

00:05:14.708 --> 00:05:17.791
The King then conquered Bostonia after a grueling seven battles

00:05:18.041 --> 00:05:20.583
Wah! Tatum’s ceiling is still lower than Fultz

00:05:20.833 --> 00:05:21.750
Hm, what’s this?

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:25.083
Bryan Colangelo is dumb and his collars are too big, ugh

00:05:25.083 --> 00:05:28.416
Wah! Brian’s collars are normal-sized, find a new slant

00:05:28.416 --> 00:05:29.500
Aw, thank you Honest Abe

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:32.625
Wah! Bryan is a class act! I worked with him. So classy!

00:05:32.625 --> 00:05:37.291
You know, when my wife decided to raise little burner ravens, I had my doubts

00:05:37.291 --> 00:05:39.583
But I’ve really grown to love you all

00:05:39.583 --> 00:05:40.958
Even you, little Jacob Reuben

00:05:40.958 --> 00:05:44.583
Wah! Bryan you’re so attractive. Jahlil failed his physical, did you know that?

00:05:44.583 --> 00:05:48.083
Oh, Phila1234567, did someone mention me?

00:05:48.958 --> 00:05:51.125
Hmm...from Joel

00:05:51.125 --> 00:05:55.166
Lord Hinkie is better and smarter than you, Eric Jr.

00:05:55.166 --> 00:05:56.416
Eric Jr.?!

00:05:56.416 --> 00:05:58.041
Wah! Wish I had a medium-sized ladder!

00:05:58.041 --> 00:05:58.791
Shh, shh!

00:05:58.791 --> 00:06:02.541
What’s this? The Curious Case of Bryan Long Collars?

00:06:02.958 --> 00:06:04.000
Wah! Normal Collar!

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:04.916
Shut up, shut up!

00:06:05.875 --> 00:06:06.833
It's long

00:06:06.875 --> 00:06:08.250
Bryan, are you in there?

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:09.166
I’m busy!

00:06:09.166 --> 00:06:14.208
Maester Detrick of the Ringer Guild has published a paper 
accusing you of using burner ravens

00:06:14.208 --> 00:06:15.208
Is this true?

00:06:15.208 --> 00:06:17.000
What? No, that’s ridiculous

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:18.333
Sorry, Honest Abe

00:06:18.333 --> 00:06:19.666
Wah! Class Act!

00:06:19.666 --> 00:06:20.666
Where is he getting all this?

00:06:20.666 --> 00:06:24.041
Some analytics wizard did an analysis of the scrolls

00:06:24.041 --> 00:06:25.458
Analytics wizard?

00:06:25.875 --> 00:06:26.958
No...

00:06:26.958 --> 00:06:27.416
[gasps]

00:06:27.416 --> 00:06:31.166
Hinkie!

00:06:43.083 --> 00:06:44.333
[knock, knock]

00:06:47.208 --> 00:06:49.083
That you, Lord Ainge?

00:06:50.375 --> 00:06:52.791
[muffled] Teamwork

00:06:54.208 --> 00:06:57.416
Gordon? Another late night of boardgaming?

00:07:01.208 --> 00:07:06.750
Alright, Terry. I think maybe you’re taking this “scary” thing a bit too far, no?

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:12.041
Your Grace? What are you doing here?

00:07:12.291 --> 00:07:12.750
Dah!

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:13.291
Aah!

00:07:13.291 --> 00:07:14.750
[pant] Hwah!

00:07:18.708 --> 00:07:20.875
It is your time

00:07:23.625 --> 00:07:26.750
Spurs of the East

00:07:27.583 --> 00:07:32.208
[screams in pain]

